Ticket 1: Investigate DigiCert Automation Capabilities
Summary

Research DigiCert automation capabilities to determine whether certificate issuance, domain validation, certificate retrieval, and lifecycle management can be automated for SILAC external certificates.

Description

Background

As part of WHC-3344 SSL Certificate Rotation Automation Spike, we need to determine the available DigiCert automation capabilities and identify the recommended approach for automating external certificate renewals.

Current certificate renewals require manual interaction with DigiCert and supporting systems. With certificate lifetimes decreasing over time, the existing manual process may become operationally challenging.

Research Areas

DigiCert CertCentral APIs
Certificate request/issuance APIs
Certificate download/retrieval APIs
Domain validation APIs and workflows
Domain validation reuse requirements
Domain pre-validation capabilities
ACME support
Trust Lifecycle Manager (TLM) capabilities
Approval workflow requirements
Billing/payment workflow limitations

Deliverables

Document available DigiCert APIs
Identify automation limitations
Document domain validation requirements
Determine whether TLM should be considered
Provide recommendation for integration approach

Linked To

WHC-3344 SSL Certificate Rotation Automation Spike

